### 0. 회원가입(HOST - PENDING TEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "host_pending@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#",
  "nickName": "HostPending",
  "phoneNumber": "010-0000-0202"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("hostPendingUserId", response.body.data.userId);
%}

### 0-1. 로그인(HOST) - accessToken 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "host_pending@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("hostPendingAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 1-1. 모임 V2 이미지 선 업로드 (png / jpg 2장) - imageKey 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{hostPendingAccessToken}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="img1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../image/resources/img1.png
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="img2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../image/resources/img2.jpg
--boundary--

> {%
  const images = response.body.data.images;
  client.global.set("p_img0_key", images[0].imageKey);
  client.global.set("p_img1_key", images[1].imageKey);
%}

### 1-2. 모임 V2 생성 (승인제 APPROVAL_REQUIRED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hostPendingAccessToken}}

{
  "title": "V2 승인제 - joinRequestMessage 포함 테스트",
  "joinPolicy": "APPROVAL_REQUIRED",
  "location": "서울 강남구",
  "locationDetail": "역삼역 근처",
  "startTime": "2026-12-20T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-12-20T21:00:00",
  "tags": ["v2", "join-requests", "pending"],
  "description": "join-requests 응답에 joinRequestMessage 포함되는지 테스트",
  "maxParticipants": 5,
  "images": [
    { "sortOrder": 0, "imageKey": "{{p_img0_key}}" },
    { "sortOrder": 1, "imageKey": "{{p_img1_key}}" }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("groupId_pendingTest", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 2. 회원가입(MEMBER - PENDING TEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member_pending@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#",
  "nickName": "MemberPending",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1111-0202"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("memberPendingId", response.body.data.userId);
%}

### 2-1. 로그인(MEMBER) - accessToken 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member_pending@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("memberPendingAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
  client.global.set("memberPendingUserId", response.body.data.user.userId);
%}

### 3. 승인제 - MEMBER 참여 (PENDING + message 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{groupId_pendingTest}}/attend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberPendingAccessToken}}

{
  "message": "안녕하세요! 참가 신청합니다. joinRequestMessage 테스트용 메시지입니다."
}

### 4. HOST - join-requests 조회 (기본: PENDING)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{groupId_pendingTest}}/attendance?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{hostPendingAccessToken}}

### 5. (옵션) MEMBER가 join-requests 조회 시도 -> 403 기대 (권한 체크)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{groupId_pendingTest}}/attendance?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{memberPendingAccessToken}}
